I've made a few small changes to dhry_gbl.h & dhry_p1.c to allow thisto run under VxWorks. The Makefile target dhryVx builds the VxWorksversion. You will have to make whatever local changes are required. Torun the program after downloading, type "main".Richard Neitzel thor@thor.atd.ucar.edu	     	Torren med sitt skjeggNational Center For Atmospheric Research	lokkar borni under sole-veggBox 3000 Boulder, CO 80307-3000			Gjo'i med sitt shinn303-497-2057					jagar borni inn.